# Wrap-Up

<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: #f7f8fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto;">

  <div>
    <h4 style="margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;">In this professional learning module, you learned how to:</h4>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 10px; font-size: 14pt">
      <li>Understand how AI generates responses and help students evaluate, question, and improve AI outputs.</li><br>
      <li>Use structured prompting and multimodal tools to guide students in generating and refining AI-assisted work ethically and effectively.</li><br>
      <li>Prepare students to design and present AI-assisted solutions through foundational web development and human-centered project work.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
